SUMMARY:Laughter Yoga Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Joan Castellano\, Certified Laughter Yoga Leader (CLYL) and Teacher (CLYT) from Laughter Yoga NJ\, as she guides you through an uplifting practice of prolonged\, voluntary laughter. Enjoy playful laughter exercises combined with yogic breathing — all practiced comfortably in a chair. \n  \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415. \n  \nSponsored by Arden Courts
