SUMMARY:Chamber Music Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:CHAMBER MUSIC CONCERT SERIES PRESENTS\nCurtis Institute of Music featuring Trio Zimbalist\n  \nOPEN TO ALL • $25/Member or Guest\nDessert reception to follow \nJosef Špaček violin\nTimotheos Gavriilidis-Petrin cello\nGeorge Xiaoyuan Fu piano \nTrio Zimbalist has been celebrated for its “highly charged performances” (The Strad) and its “liveliness and vigor of playing” (Athinorama). The trio is lauded for its masterful interpretations of repertoire spanning from Classical and Romantic masterworks to today’s most lauded composers. \nPURCHASE TICKETS
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/trio-zimbalist-2026/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Event,The Gaelen
