SUMMARY:November-December Art Exhibit: WAE Less is WAE More
DESCRIPTION:The WAE Center at JSDD is a holistic arts learning program for adults with developmental disabilities focused on adaptive arts and personal growth. This exhibit reveals both the artists’ perspectives and the world they seek to reflect. \n  \n    \n\n  \nOPENING RECEPTION\nSunday\, November 15\, 1–3 pm\nLight refreshments will be served.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/november-december-art-exhibit/
