SUMMARY:Zumba Party - Fall '26
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to move\, sweat\, and smile!\nJoin us for a high-energy Zumba Party where the music is pumping\, the vibes are welcoming\, and the only goal is to have FUN. Whether you’re a seasoned dancer or just looking to try something new\, this feel-good workout is for everyone — no experience needed! \nFeel the beat with our awesome instructors — Sandra\, Alejandra\, Rachael\, and Bethsaida — who will keep you motivated\, energized\, and dancing from start to finish. \nStick around after class to cool down and connect — fruit\, water\, and healthy snacks provided after the party.. \nOpen to all.  Advance registration recquired.\n \nFREE for Members\n$30 Nonmembers \nRegister Here\n  \n 
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/zumba-fall2026/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Gymnasium\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fitness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/FIT26-Spring-Zumba-Party_hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Biola Akoh":MAILTO:bakoh@jccmetrowest.org
END:VEVENT
