SUMMARY:Olive Press
DESCRIPTION:Discover the Oil Behind the Hanukkah Miracle\nHow do olives become oil? Join us for a fun\, interactive demonstration that brings this Hanukkah connection to life! Families will discover how olive oil is made and explore its special role in the story of Hanukkah. Let’s learn\, explore\, and celebrate the Festival of Lights together!\nLight refreshments will be served. \nFree & Open to All.  Registration Required.\nRegister by December 3 \nRegister Here
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/olive-press/
