SUMMARY:Unlock the Power of the Mind-Body Connection Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Are you feeling stressed\, overwhelmed\, or disconnected? Join Ellen Robertson\, Wellness Director at the J\, and learn how your thoughts\, emotions\, and physical health are deeply linked—and learn practical tools to bring them into balance. \nWhat You’ll Learn: \n\nHow thoughts and emotions impact physical health\nTechniques to reduce stress and improve mental clarity\nSimple breathing and mindfulness exercises\nWays to boost energy\, focus\, and overall well-being\nStrategies to create lasting mind-body harmony\n\nWhat to Expect: \n\nGuided mindfulness and relaxation practices\nGentle movement and body awareness exercises\nHow to weave these tools into your daily self care\n\n  \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/mind-body-connection/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/FIT27-Mind–Body-Connection_hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Ellen Robertson":MAILTO:erobertson@jccmetrowest.org
GEO:40.7674616;-74.2963088
