SUMMARY:Life Long Learning: Lessons From the Dugout: Talking Baseball with Ken Davidoff
DESCRIPTION:Longtime New York baseball writer Ken Davidoff shares the personal and professional journey that took him from growing up in New Jersey to covering Major League Baseball for major media outlets—and ultimately inspired his first book. \nAbout the speaker: Ken Davidoff is a veteran baseball writer with more than 30 years of experience\, former president of the Baseball Writers’ Association of America\, former New York Post columnist\, and a regular contributor to MLB Network\, YES Network\, and Fox 5 New York. \nFREE for JCC Member; $15 Nonmember\n \nRegister Here\n  \nSponsored by:
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/lll-lessons-from-the-dugout/
